00:00:15.484 --> 00:00:16.317
Thank you, thank you.

00:00:16.317 --> 00:00:17.623
It's really nice. It's really nice. Yeah.

00:00:17.623 --> 00:00:19.371
- [Kelly] It's awesome to
be doing something you love

00:00:19.371 --> 00:00:20.204
and to be successful.

00:00:20.204 --> 00:00:21.037
- Yeah.

00:00:21.037 --> 00:00:21.870
(kelly makes trumpet noises)

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:24.922
Yeah, I mean, I am
living my dream right now

00:00:24.922 --> 00:00:26.223
